LOG -- where UUCPbb writes its logs===================================uucico, uuxqt and the mail programs in /dd/CMDS/UUCP write here:uulog, and one file per remote site.  `uulog` reads them back.The directory ships empty apart from this note, because nothing hasdialled anywhere yet.  Under os9exec nothing will: there is no serialline to dial out of.  On a real machine with a modem, this fills up.